# coords.csv
Coordinates directly surrounding the 1-80 Causeway
The three pixels directly North and South of the midline of the causeway
Coordinates selected used Google Earth Pro
C=Center, W=West, E=East

# sunset_times.csv
Sunset times from 2013 to 2025
Generated using https://gml.noaa.gov/grad/solcalc/calcdetails.html

#MOE_times
Moment of emergence times for June and August of 2013 and 2019-2023
Blank dates means that the video was unable to be downloaded or no clear MOE was present
CSV files generated from Excel file
Must be in csv format to work with Load and Create Dataframes.R
